	abstract = {We consider stratified ruling permitting different degrees of {MIQ} with different scores for different application domain licensing, passing Alan Turing test of Artificial Intelligence ({AI}) with different scores, and ranking a different {MIQ}. A recent breakthrough of the ultimate intelligence called Natural Intelligence ({NI}) has elucidated how smart pairs of sensory are processing 1. This is based on the common observation of animal kingdom that all intelligent brains operate at isothermal equilibrium (man ∼37°C; chicken ∼40°C), and all intelligent animals adopt a power of pairs of input 5 sensors (eyes, ears, smells, tastes, tactile) without evolutional exception. This theorem has solved the dual usages of unsupervised {ATR} by means of multiple-spectral remote imaging, and early breast cancer detection in close-up multi-spectral imaging5. We will further support power of pair's sensors for the input to the autopilot controls system among a team of mini-{UAS} for the reliable autonomous collision avoidance among themselves and with other jumbo aircraft coming above and behind their ways. Since we have designed a team of {UAVs}, more than 4, equipped with L-band cellular phone transceivers each can accomplish in principle collectively interferometer Synthetic Aperture Radar, we are looking how to control command a team of closely flying {UAVs} for the reason of coherence. We follow the perturbation to the equilibrium theory of Nash cooperative gaming theory to formulate explicitly the aerodynamic interaction forces: drag, lift, turbulent vortices, among team of {UAVs}, in order to modify auto-pilot to avoid collision among neighbors. Since military applications of mini-{UAS} have been demonstrated to be beneficial in the warfighting capability, {ONR} is seeking help driving the cost down by the transition of military know-how to command, control, communication, and collision avoidance. Thus, we support risk reduction dual usage efforts.},
